        "heading": "ABOUT THIS CHAPTER",
        "show_warp_icon": true,
        "katha": "Varanasi has woven silk and gold for centuries, and its looms still set the standard for the Indian wedding saree. If you have been looking for a real Banarasi saree online, one woven by hand in Varanasi rather than copied on a powerloom, start here.",
